    "en": [
      "Purchase the cheapest available property on your starting region first—early turnover on low-value properties builds the compounding income base needed to afford elite properties in later years without debt.",
      "Kintaro Cards (doubles destination arrival bonus) should be reserved for high-value destinations during the final 5 years of a match, not spent in early years when station values are lower.",
      "Bomberman targeting logic: Bomberman chases the player in first place. If you are in the lead, invest defensively in mortgage-resistant stations rather than aggressive high-value purchases to minimise Bomberman damage.",
      "Milk Cards provide debt erasure—keep one Milk Card in hand whenever your total debt approaches 100 million yen, as a single Bomberman event at that debt level can lose the match outright.",
      "The Japan Map goal selection window appears each New Year—choose goals in the geographic direction of the highest-value unclaimed stations to double-dip on destination bonuses and property acquisition in the same movement arc."
