        "title": "Final 5 Years Closing Strategy",
        "body": "With 5 years remaining, shift from property acquisition to goal-point maximisation. Use Kintaro and Special Cards exclusively on high-value destination goals (100 million yen bonus range). If in second place, use Poverty Card on the leader within 3 years of the end to trigger a Bomberman event during their most vulnerable economic phase. The most common endgame upset: a player in second spends all remaining years acquiring bonus cards and converts them in the final year when the leader cannot respond."
